Z||000001||Sootah||05-12-2001||01:39 AM||||     How many computers do you have at home? What is it hooked up to? Hub / Direct cable? It it is the direct cable then the wiring in it may be wrong, try another one. If you are up to a hub, try another cable in that case too.<P>     The other thing that I can think of is an IP conflict. See if any other computers are useing the same address as you.<P>------------------<BR>Never argue with an idiot, they drag you down to their level and then beat you with experience||||reg||1
